# Quirri Agent Pack (mandatory)

Canonical pack: `docs/agent/` — `prod.md` · `architecture.md` · `rules.md` · `design.md` · `design-system.md` · `task.md` · `memory.md`

## Every turn

1. Follow **`docs/agent/task.md`** BEFORE / DURING / AFTER checklists.
2. Memory: **`docs/agent/memory.md`** — Code Graph first (`graphify query` budget 1500); update after edits.
3. Scope: **`docs/agent/prod.md`** — out of scope → ask user (also `quirri-sow-scope.mdc`).
4. Existing always-apply rules still apply (`quirri-forms`, `quirri-product-ui`, brand, login freeze, no-plans, India, graphify, development). This pack **indexes** them; it does not override them.
5. Token protocol: Code Graph → Semantic search on hits → Context packing (only needed agent docs + hit files) → Symbol-aware edits → SOW/API intelligence. Do not dump the whole repo or `GRAPH_REPORT.md` into context.
6. Altering existing code: bring touched files into compliance with `rules.md` / `design.md` / `design-system.md`.
7. Any UI change: `design-system.md` §6 BEFORE and §7 AFTER checklists are mandatory (`quirri-design-system.mdc`).
8. Entry: `AGENTS.md` points here.
